{"slug":"k-y-l","ar":"ك ي ل","total":16,"core":"measuring","forms":[{"ar":"كَيْل","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":10,"gloss":"Measure (of goods)","word":"kayl","ex":{"s":26,"a":181,"p":2,"ar":["أَوْفُوا۟","ٱلْكَيْلَ","وَلَا","تَكُونُوا۟","مِنَ","ٱلْمُخْسِرِينَ"],"en":"Give full measure and do not be of those who cause loss"}},{"ar":"كَالُ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":2,"gloss":"to measure out","word":null,"ex":{"s":83,"a":3,"p":2,"ar":["وَإِذَا","كَالُوهُمْ","أَو","وَّزَنُوهُمْ","يُخْسِرُونَ"],"en":"But if they give by measure or by weight to them, they cause loss"}},{"ar":"مِكْيَال","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"measure","word":null,"ex":{"s":11,"a":85,"p":3,"ar":["وَيَـٰقَوْمِ","أَوْفُوا۟","ٱلْمِكْيَالَ","وَٱلْمِيزَانَ","بِٱلْقِسْطِ ۖ","وَلَا","تَبْخَسُوا۟","ٱلنَّاسَ","أَشْيَآءَهُمْ","وَلَا","تَعْثَوْا۟","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","مُفْسِدِينَ"],"en":"And O my people, give full measure and weight in justice and do not deprive the people of their due and do not commit abuse on the earth, spreading corruption"}},{"ar":"ٱكْتَالُ","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":2,"gloss":"to take by measure","word":null,"ex":{"s":83,"a":2,"p":3,"ar":["ٱلَّذِينَ","إِذَا","ٱكْتَالُوا۟","عَلَى","ٱلنَّاسِ","يَسْتَوْفُونَ"],"en":"Who, when they take a measure from people, take in full"}}],"surahs":[[12,7],[11,2],[17,2],[83,2],[6,1],[7,1],[26,1]]}